[Mission.Objectives]
Stop the attack on Sbeitla
[Mission.Description]
Lieutenant Colonel Waters! Germans are advancing on Sbeitla. You must blunt their attack and hold the objective, a possible staging area for an attack on the village.
[Mission.Success]
The order has been carried out! The enemy couldn't capture a staging are for their attack on Sbeitla.
[Mission.Failed]
Our troops have been defeated and the Germans are preparing an offensive on Sbeitla.
[Submission1.Objectives]
Hold the line
[Submission1.Description]
Hold the line! The enemy must not capture this staging area!
[Submission1.Success]
The enemy has been defeated and is fleeing!
[Submission1.Failed]
The enemy has crushed the defenses and is preparing an offensive on Sbeitla!
[StringTable.Reinf]
Colonel Waters! Reinforcements are on the way. Hold tight!
[StringTable.Woters]
Reinforcements have arrived.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Secure the point
[Submission2.Description]
The Germans are trying to capture the radio point. You must attack the enemy and secure the point.
[Submission2.Success]
The enemy has failed!
[Submission2.Failed]
The enemy has captured the radio point!
[Submission3.Objectives]
Re-establish radio contact
[Submission3.Description]
Eliminate the enemy securing the height and re-establish radio contact!
[Submission3.Success]
The enemy has been eliminated! Radio contact has been re-established!
[Submission3.Failed]
The enemy has repelled our attack!
[StringTable.Enemy]
Soldiers! Action!
[StringTable.Enemy2]
Enemy on the left flank!
[StringTable.Enemy1_1]
Enemy on the right flank!
[StringTable.Enemy1_2]
Enemy is trying to get to the rear!
